      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "AYLA ZORRO (2) turned in a plain effort last time when sixth at Hobart over 461m behind Motorsport (26.50) in a Grade 4. Should be very hard to beat this time. ZIPPING POITIER (8) wound up strongly to place two back then did the same last time, finishing on late when second (19.89) in a Other at Hobart. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings six times from eight attempts. Can measure up. VERY SNEAKY (6) finds it hard to break through. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (19.98) at Hobart. Solid record here winning two races. Expected to be in this for a long way. BUCKLE UP EASTON (1) can find the frame without surprising.",
